#: crypto.cpp:226
msgid ""
"<h1>Crypto</h1> This module allows you to configure SSL for use with most KDE "
"applications, as well as manage your personal certificates and the known "
"certificate authorities."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Serläw</h1> KDE yazılımnarı öçen SSL totuın caylaw, şäxsi tanıqlıqlar "
"citäkläw eşen bu modul aşa qılıp bula."

#: crypto.cpp:239
msgid "kcmcrypto"
msgstr "kcmcrypto"

#: crypto.cpp:239
msgid "KDE Crypto Control Module"
msgstr "KDE'neñ Serläw İdärä Modulı"

#: crypto.cpp:241
msgid "(c) 2000 - 2001 George Staikos"
msgstr "(c) 2000 - 2001 George Staikos"

#: crypto.cpp:267
msgid "Enable &TLS support if supported by the server"
msgstr "Bu server totaqan çaqta &TLS aşa eşlise"

#: crypto.cpp:270
msgid ""
"TLS is the newest revision of the SSL protocol. It integrates better with other "
"protocols and has replaced SSL in protocols such as POP3 and SMTP."
msgstr ""
"TLS digäne ul SSL protokolınıñ yaña töre. Ul başqa protokollar belän dä "
"yaqşıraq eşli, POP3/SMTP eşlägändä dä SSL protokolın üze belän almaştırğan."

#: crypto.cpp:275
msgid "Enable SSLv&2"
msgstr "SSLv&2 belän"

#: crypto.cpp:278
msgid ""
"SSL v2 is the second revision of the SSL protocol. It is most common to enable "
"v2 and v3."
msgstr ""
"SSL v2 digäne ul SSL protokolıñın ikençe söreme. Töp oçraqlarda v2 dä, v3 tä "
"qullanuğa açu yaqşıraq."

#: crypto.cpp:282
msgid "Enable SSLv&3"
msgstr "SSLv&3 belän"

#: crypto.cpp:285
msgid ""
"SSL v3 is the third revision of the SSL protocol. It is most common to enable "
"v2 and v3."
msgstr ""
"SSL v3 digäne ul SSL protokolıñın öçençe söreme. Töp oçraqlarda v2 dä, v3 tä "
"qullanuğa açu yaqşıraq."

#: crypto.cpp:291
msgid "SSLv2 Ciphers to Use"
msgstr "SSLv2 Ciphers Qullanası"

#: crypto.cpp:292
msgid ""
"Select the ciphers you wish to enable when using the SSL v2 protocol. The "
"actual protocol used will be negotiated with the server at connection time."
msgstr ""
"SSL v2 protokolı eşlägändä qullanası kilgän serlämälär saylaw. Törle yaqlanğan "
"serverlär belän totaşqan çaqta bu serlämälär qullanılaçaq."

#: crypto.cpp:302
msgid ""
"SSL ciphers cannot be configured because this module was not linked with "
"OpenSSL."
msgstr ""
"Bu modul cíğanda OpenSSL öleşe östälenmägängä säbäple SSL-serlämälär caylap "
"bulmí."

#: crypto.cpp:317
msgid "SSLv3 Ciphers to Use"
msgstr "SSLv3 Ciphers Qullanası"

#: crypto.cpp:318
msgid ""
"Select the ciphers you wish to enable when using the SSL v3 protocol. The "
"actual protocol used will be negotiated with the server at connection time."
msgstr ""
"SSL v3 protokolı eşlägändä qullanası kilgän serlämälär saylaw. Törle yaqlanğan "
"serverlär belän totaşqan çaqta bu serlämälär qullanılaçaq. "

#: crypto.cpp:332
msgid "Cipher Wizard"
msgstr "Serläw Ostası"

#: crypto.cpp:335
msgid ""
"<qt>Use these preconfigurations to more easily configure the SSL encryption "
"settings. You can choose among the following modes: "
"<ul>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>SSL serläwen köyläw eşen ciñeläytü öçen bu caybiremnär qullanası. Bu "
"ısullar arasında berärsen saylap bula: "
"<ul>"

#: crypto.cpp:338
msgid "Most Compatible"
msgstr "İñ Kileşkän"

#: crypto.cpp:339
msgid ""
"<li><b>Most Compatible:</b> Select the settings found to be most "
"compatible.</li>"
msgstr ""
"<li><b>İñ Kileşkännär:</b> İñ keleşkän bulıp tabılğan köylämälär saylaw.</li>"

#: crypto.cpp:340
msgid "US Ciphers Only"
msgstr "AQŞ Serlämäse Genä"

#: crypto.cpp:341
msgid ""
"<li><b>US Ciphers Only:</b> Select only the US strong (&gt;= 128 bit) "
"encryption ciphers.</li>"
msgstr ""
"<li><b>AQŞ Serlämäse Genä:</b> AQŞ öçen genä bulğan köçle (&gt;= 128 bit) "
"serläw ısulın saylaw.</li>"

#: crypto.cpp:342
msgid "Export Ciphers Only"
msgstr "Sercömlälär Genä Çığarası"

#: crypto.cpp:343
msgid ""
"<li><b>Export Ciphers Only:</b> Select only the weak ciphers (&lt;= 56 "
"bit).</li>"
msgstr ""
"<li><b>Serläw Genä Çığarası:</b> Kiräksez serläw genä saylísı (&lt;= 56 "
"bit).</li>"

#: crypto.cpp:344
msgid "Enable All"
msgstr "Barın Aç"

#: crypto.cpp:345
msgid "<li><b>Enable All:</b> Select all SSL ciphers and methods.</li></ul>"
msgstr ""
"<li><b>Barısın Açası:</b> SSL serläw ısullarnıñ barısın da açası.</li></ul>"

#: crypto.cpp:356
msgid "Warn on &entering SSL mode"
msgstr "SSL ısulğa &kergändä belderäse"

#: crypto.cpp:359
msgid "If selected, you will be notified when entering an SSL enabled site"
msgstr "Yanıq torsa, SSL belän säxifägä kergän çaqta belderü çığaçaq."

#: crypto.cpp:363
msgid "Warn on &leaving SSL mode"
msgstr "SSL ısuldan &çıqqanda belderäse"

#: crypto.cpp:366
msgid "If selected, you will be notified when leaving an SSL based site."
msgstr "Yanıq torsa, SSL belän säxifädän çıqqan çaqta belderü çığaçaq."

#: crypto.cpp:370
msgid "Warn on sending &unencrypted data"
msgstr "Serlänmägän birem &cibärgändä belderäse"

#: crypto.cpp:373
msgid ""
"If selected, you will be notified before sending unencrypted data via a web "
"browser."
msgstr ""
"Yanıq torsa, web gizgeç aşa serlänmägän belem künderelgän çaqta belderü "
"çığaçaq."

#: crypto.cpp:378
msgid "Warn on &mixed SSL/non-SSL pages"
msgstr "SSL/SSL-bulmağan &qatnaş bitlär turında belderäse"

#: crypto.cpp:381
msgid ""
"If selected, you will be notified if you view a page that has both encrypted "
"and non-encrypted parts."
msgstr ""
"Yanıq torsa, kürsätelgän bit eçendä serlängän dä serlänmägän dä öleşlär bulğan "
"çaqta belderü çığaçaq."

#: crypto.cpp:394
msgid "Path to OpenSSL Shared Libraries"
msgstr "OpenSSL Büleşkän Tuplamasına Yul"

#: crypto.cpp:398
msgid "&Test"
msgstr "&Sınaw"

#: crypto.cpp:408
msgid "Use EGD"
msgstr "EGD qullanası"

#: crypto.cpp:410
msgid "Use entropy file"
msgstr "Entropy biremen qullanu"

#: crypto.cpp:418 crypto.cpp:2312
msgid "Path to EGD:"
msgstr "EGD yulı:"

#: crypto.cpp:424
msgid ""
"If selected, OpenSSL will be asked to use the entropy gathering daemon (EGD) "
"for initializing the pseudo-random number generator."
msgstr ""
"Yanıq torsa, yasalma-oçraqlı san ürçätkeçen äzerläw öçen, OpenSSL tarafınnan "
"entropy tuplaw xezmäte (EGD) qullanılaçaq."

#: crypto.cpp:427
msgid ""
"If selected, OpenSSL will be asked to use the given file as entropy for "
"initializing the pseudo-random number generator."
msgstr ""
"Yanıq torsa, yasalma-oçraqlı san ürçätkeçen äzerläw öçen, OpenSSL tarafınnan "
"entropy urınına bu birem qullanılaçaq."

#: crypto.cpp:430
msgid ""
"Enter the path to the socket created by the entropy gathering daemon (or the "
"entropy file) here."
msgstr ""
"Entropy cíu xezmäte yasağan soket (yä ki entropy biremenä) taba yul kertäse."

#: crypto.cpp:433
msgid "Click here to browse for the EGD socket file."
msgstr "Bonda çirtep, bu EGD yöyä biremen küzätep bula."

